--- errors
NameException 'missing_var' is not defined
TemplateException expected an expression, got ')'
TemplateException <if> is never closed with </if>
TypeException <if> condition must be bool, got list — compare explicitly, e.g. 'items.len() > 0'
TemplateException view "nope.missing" not found (looked for views/nope/missing.bq)
ValueException invalid view name "../secret" — use dots or slashes, e.g. "users.index"
dict has no key "age" (keys: "name") — use ?.age if it may be missing
<else> must be inside <if> or <each>
unclosed { — write \{ for a literal brace
